This makes sure the new ccu8540 DTB file is generated by
the build system.

Cc: Lee Jones <lee.jones-QSEj5FYQhm4dnm+yROfE0A@public.gmane.org>
Cc: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez.st-Re5JQEeQqe8AvxtiuMwx3w@public.gmane.org>
